    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Independent type foundry founded by Sam Glen Hughes (credited as Sam G. Hughes) in 2019, still active and releasing typefaces (Sometimes Times, Office Times, Oatmeal Pro, Lothian Sans, Kale Sans, BL Melody, BL Pylon, Helium Serif). Own site states based in Victoria, Canada (also on Behance as Canada), though its Facebook page lists Edinburgh and several typeface names (Lothian, Murrayfield) suggest Scottish roots, so treat the country as hedged. Founder-led, likely small/solo practice despite calling itself a collaborative studio; also runs a newer parallel storefront at boulevardtype.com. No LinkedIn company page found after search.",
